{
  "name": "BasicAuthForge - nano-tools",
  "short_name": "BasicAuthForge",
  "description": "HTTP Basic Auth 工具：把 用户名:密码 编码为 Authorization: Basic &lt;base64&gt; 请求头（纯 JS Base64，含 UTF-8 支持），也可反向解析 Base64 还原用户名与密码，调试接口鉴权时随手可用。 · 单文件 · 零依赖 · 本地优先",
  "start_url": "./",
  "scope": "./",
  "display": "standalone",
  "background_color": "#0A0A0B",
  "theme_color": "#5E6AD2",
  "icons": [
    {
      "src": "og.svg",
      "sizes": "any",
      "type": "image/svg+xml",
      "purpose": "any"
    }
  ]
}
